### Close a resolved ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/closure
Authorization: Bearer {{support_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "18"
Idempotency-Key: close-ticket-6c2ad02e-v18-001
X-Correlation-ID: 0c14df25-5b4b-45cd-b535-a06ad2cb70f8

{
  "closeReasonCode": "REQUESTER_CONFIRMED",
  "closeReason": "Requester confirmed the issue is resolved and no further action is required."
}

### Reopen a closed ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{support_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "19"
Idempotency-Key: reopen-ticket-6c2ad02e-v19-001
X-Correlation-ID: e6a60fe2-52d6-4e07-85ab-ff1837f41d76

{
  "reopenReasonCode": "ISSUE_RECURRED",
  "reopenReason": "The requester reported the same endpoint enrollment failure returned after reboot."
}

### Invalid: close an in-progress ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/closure
Authorization: Bearer {{support_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "20"
Idempotency-Key: close-ticket-6c2ad02e-invalid-state

{
  "closeReasonCode": "SUPPORT_CONFIRMED",
  "closeReason": "Support attempts to close before resolution."
}
